# Code owners for the security-critical CI/CD supply chain.
#
# This declares who must review changes to these paths. It is ENFORCED only when
# the repository's branch-protection rule for `master` has "Require review from
# Code Owners" enabled — the file is the prerequisite; the setting is the switch.
# Rationale: the supply-chain regression guard (tests/ci_supply_chain_test.mjs)
# defends against ACCIDENTAL regressions; a deliberate bypass requires editing
# these files, so a human owner review on them is the real control there
# (SECURITY.md invariant 25).

# All workflows + the extracted gate scripts.
/.github/                              @ndokutovich

# The trust-boundary doc, the supply-chain guard, and the gate-script tests.
/SECURITY.md                           @ndokutovich
/tests/ci_supply_chain_test.mjs        @ndokutovich
/tests/release_scripts_test.mjs        @ndokutovich

# The security backbone source of truth (roles, RLS, grants).
/docker/init.sql                       @ndokutovich
